  "title": "Creamy Pork with Sour Cream Sauce",
  "description": "Pork cube steaks are coated in seasoned bread crumbs, fried to a golden brown, then baked with sauteed mushrooms in a delicious sour cream, broth, and cream of chicken soup sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "KELLYGOFF"
  ],
